sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as the orchestrator
    participant T as the ticket file<br/>in your checkout
    participant B as the ticket file<br/>on the ticket branch
    participant W as the worker
    O->>T: status: claimed
    O->>W: the ticket's context
    W->>B: its questions, its closing comment
    W->>B: status: review
    Note over B,W: the worker's words are on its branch alone
    W-->>O: exits, and the orchestrator reads the flip off the branch
    O->>T: status: review
    Note over O,T: `tracker rule` has no question to answer here yet
    O->>T: the merge brings the branch's copy in
